.com/p/pasta-grannies-is-now-on-substack","suggested":true,"kind":"youtube"},{"name":"Recipes from Italy","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"recipesfromitaly.com","note":"Traditional Italian recipes written by Italian home cooks, organized by region and course.","url":"https://recipesfromitaly.com","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"Manu's Menu","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"manusmenu.com","note":"Italian-born home cook Manuela sharing classic family and regional Italian dishes.","url":"https://www.manusmenu.com/about/about-this-site","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Italian cuisine","links":[["Acquacotta","dish/acquacotta"],["Agliata","dish/agliata"],["Agnolotti","dish/agnolotti"],["Antipasto","dish/antipasto"],["Arancini","dish/arancini"],["Biscotti","dish/biscotti"],["Bolinhos de bacalhau","dish/bolinhos-de-bacalhau"],["Bombolone","dish/bombolone"],["Budino","dish/budino"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-roll"],["Caesar salad","dish/caesar-salad"],["Cannelloni","dish/cannelloni"],["Capellini","dish/capellini"],["Carbonara","dish/carbonara"],["Carpaccio","dish/carpaccio"],["Cassatella di sant'Agata","dish/cassatella-di-sant-agata"],["Cassoeula","dish/cassoeula"],["Ciabatta","dish/ciabatta"],["Cioppino","dish/cioppino"],["Coda alla vaccinara","dish/coda-alla-vaccinara"],["Colomba pasquale","dish/colomba-pasquale"],["Conti roll","dish/conti-roll"],["Cotoletta alla bolognese","dish/cotoletta-alla-bolognese"],["Crostata","dish/crostata"],["Drago restaurants","dish/drago-restaurants"],["Focaccia pugliese","dish/focaccia-pugliese"],["Frittata","dish/frittata"],["Giardiniera","dish/giardiniera"],["Guanciale","dish/guanciale"],["Italian restaurant","dish/italian-restaurant"],["Italian wedding soup","dish/italian-wedding-soup"],["Lampredotto","dish/lampredotto"],["Lasagna","dish/lasagna"],["List of Italian restaurants","dish/list-of-italian-restaurants"],["Marinara sauce","dish/marinara-sauce"],["Mondeghili","dish/mondeghili"],["Paccheri